<title>USA: TABLE- United Technologies Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE- United Technologies Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Technologies Corp</p>
<p>		 Condensed consolidated statement of operations</p>
<p>			    (Unaudited)</p>
<p>		 (Millions of dollars, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				     Quarter ended  Six months ended</p>
<p>					   June 30,	 June 30,</p>
<p>			     1997	   1996	1997	 1996</p>
<p>Revenues</p>
<p> Otis		     $1,397	$1,401    $2,765     $2,704</p>
<p> Carrier		   1,691	 1,634     3,078	2,959</p>
<p> Automotive		  782	   861     1,523	1,605</p>
<p> Pratt &amp; Whitney	 1,944	 1,533     3,663	2,949</p>
